OL,3,GNEWSA'We want dad home after paddling
OL,4,Apool spinal injury'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs temperatures began to soar during
OL,7,Fthe late May bank holiday, Brogan and
OL,8,Fher family - like many others - were
OL,9,Flooking for ways to make the most of
OL,10,Fthe weather.
OL,12,FHer husband Sam, 38, went out to the
OL,13,Fshops to buy his family a large
OL,14,Fpaddling pool for their garden in
OL,15,FSolihull, filling it up straight away
OL,16,Ffor their children to use.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
