OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'We want dad home after paddling
OL,4,Apool spinal injury'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut what was supposed to be a weekend
OL,7,Fof playing out in the sun became what
OL,8,FBrogan has described as her family's
OL,9,Fworst nightmare, after Sam dived in and
OL,10,Fstruck the bottom of the pool
OL,11,Fheadfirst.
OL,13,F"He was face down in the water," Brogan
OL,14,Frecalled. "When I turned him over, I
OL,15,Frealised this was an emergency.
